differences among all pairs except those including other race and ethnicity and other employment status.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Bonferroni-corrected p-value <0.05), only sociodemographic and location comparisons where the prevalence ratio is >1.3 will be discussed.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Multiple imputation techniques were used to account for missing data.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"SAS (version 9.4; SAS Institute) and SUDAAN (version 11.0; RTI International) were used to account for survey weights and the complex sampling design.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The SAS multiple imputation procedure using the fully conditional specification method generated multiple (five) data sets\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}